(text "DRAFT: isolated 12V input; 3.3V / 0.5A output. No connection to raw PoE.\nEN tied to input; SLEEP tied to 3.3V for normal operation.\nAlways on while the isolated input is present; downstream cuts must not gate this rail." (at 40.64 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d0ff83b6-e913-5ac7-8a65-401d8cabb460"))
(text "TI SLVSB35C, Figure 8 / Tables 2-3. 10uH + 22uF nominal.\nCapacitor DC bias, complete rail load and layout review remain open.\nRoute VOS as Kelvin sense after L401; join AGND / PGND / exposed pad locally." (at 40.64 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a6b838f-006c-5f16-93c9-976c94a77503"))
